{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:eefac0ff23eeb160","name":"Combat Reflexes","source":{"id":"source:reference-eefac0ff23eeb160","title":"Combat Reflexes","revision":26021,"timestamp":"2025-01-20T20:32:49Z","sha256":"abd4ac341ffc2a17b816afe05830f862725f7f318baa722a982072dbfeb3064b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26021","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Combat%20Reflexes&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-eefac0ff23eeb160","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can respond quickly and repeatedly to opponents who let their guard down.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," When opponents leave themselves open, you may make a number of additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," modifier.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For example, a character with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," of 15 can make a total of three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," in a round: the one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," every character is entitled to, plus two more attacks because of their +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus. If four ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stormtroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stormtroopers"}," move through the character's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threatened Area"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threatened_Area"},", they can make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," against three of the four. You still only make one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," on a single opponent.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["With this Feat, you may also make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," while ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Normal:"]}," A character without the Combat Reflexes Feat can make only one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," per round, and can't make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," while ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Combined Feat:"]}," You may use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Return Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Return_Fire","referenceId":"reference:cd9a55d711590d9a"}," Feat a number of times during an encounter equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus, but no more than once during a given enemy's turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
